{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bJieSdAJN11792766734.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國消費信心稍低過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>密歇根大學消費信心指數10月報48，高過市場預期，但略低過9月的48.1，顯示民眾對通脹和家庭收入前景的樂觀態度輕微降溫。</p><p></p><p>消費者的短期通脹預測保持平穩。未來一年通脹預測維持於百分之4.7，與9月和市場預期相同。未來五年通脹預測為百分之3.5，符合市場預期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:27.133566+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T19:38:01.224008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T15:47:36.427288+00:00","content_hash":"18ba940b8a015494d9a5efa0f7abe06e2163fdbbf8386d9fda29a8c7c571565e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T15:53:27.133566+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}